    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KOTA: The Survival</strong> is set in a world abandoned by humanity, where robots struggle to survive. In their quest to restore the land and bring back its former glory, they build wonders from scraps, plastic waste, and metal parts. This game immerses players in a world where creativity and resourcefulness are key to reviving a desolate landscape. As you explore and construct, you'll uncover the remnants of a once-thriving civilization, working to re-green the planet and give life a second chance.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KOTA: The Survival</strong> is set in a world abandoned by humanity, where robots struggle to survive. In their quest to restore the land and bring back its former glory, they build wonders from scraps, plastic waste, and metal parts. This game immerses players in a world where creativity and resourcefulness are key to reviving a desolate landscape. As you explore and construct, you'll uncover the remnants of a once-thriving civilization, working to re-green the planet and give life a second chance.</p>",
    "short_description": "In a post-apocalyptic world abandoned by humans, control robots as they gather resources, fight enemies, and rebuild the planet using recycled materials. KOTA: The Survival lets you revive nature and craft a new future!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Russian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Thai, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
